-- Sevopedia — Leaders: New **AI Personality panel** with raw attributes and cross-leader comparisons, and optional **grouping by civilization (with an icon)**. See also [SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py](/Assets/Python/Contrib/Sevopedia/SevoPediaLeaderAIPValues.py). Beautify **Traits with icon characters**. Make a free promotion's UnitCombats span **in the same line** instead of taking too much vertical space, and **add a blank line between Traits** for readability. Also **add linking** to their **corresponding Sevopedia Traits entry**: change in [CvGameTextMgr.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvGameTextMgr.cpp). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5502+) Add **Attitude** (furious, annoyed, cautious, pleased, friendly), **Action buttons** (noanim/idle, greeting, agree, disagree), and (if set) **leaderhead art era buttons**. On click, the animation changes its behaviour to that of the buttons clicked. See also: [How to read the AI Personality panel](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_AI_Personality_Panel.md#displaying-the-ai-attributes-in-the-ai-personality-panel-and-how-to-read-the-tablespanels). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5529+) Moved **BACK/NEXT/EXIT** buttons (in the **footer**) to **the left of the AI Personality Panel** so they are clickable despite intentional vertical overflow of the AI Personality Panel (to maximize usable space and show more rows/fields). Note: **AI Personality Panel categories' organization** is adjusted depending on **vertical room** (**resolutionY**); e.g., since higher resolutions like 1440p have more vertical room that allows to show categories like ACL-related categories (that are not visible at 1080p), we optimize this further by moving **No War At** from `middle_categories` to `left_categories` so the middle column has enough room to fully show ACL-related categories.
-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5512+) Also make **item bar shorter** with a **per font size tunable width** to accommodate the **AI Personality panel wider columns when text is upscaled**. Note: this applied **only for lower resolutions**, because higher resolutions have enough width to accomodate an enlarged AI Personality Panel when text is upscaled, so there is no need to reduce item bar width in Sevopedia Leader to accomodate it.
